{"title":"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy the following system of equations:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b069ba2c62a2ff4b043319257f8e13275e233df1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{t + u} = 2^{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /></center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/2/462aff46afb02f0a9bd7d9059d71bc474308bb04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{u - 3} = 5^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The bases are equal to each other and aren't equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in both equations, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264b9e3aca5b65a63f499211852a6ba08db5335b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u - 3 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f549c6e89fdcf1cc658e1151225863dffadbf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = 2 + 3 = \\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"122\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d11e58cee6cad5ea810fda85efe086bb86c0547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t + u = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fecdeea95713cd58d33616009151bf913810e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t + 5 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/f/5ef929533eb204eb3862f329e1f9a2b9e63d4bcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 8 - 5 = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"118\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018065731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 51/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1978/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.205      1 2024_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\n100.00%    6.205      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37453:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018065731 and revision id 289472. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}